      </tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>

  <p>In addition, many insurers offer a no-claims refund (<em>Beitragsrückerstattung</em>): if you submit zero claims in a calendar year, you receive back one to three monthly premiums, effectively making your net annual cost significantly lower.</p>

  <p>These incentives work well for young, healthy people who rarely see doctors. As you age and medical costs increase, a lower deductible becomes more valuable. Most people start with a moderate deductible and reduce it as they get older.</p>

